 "words_heard": 183,
 "words": 187,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I lie awake and count the bills, I count the hours till day",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I write the lists of all I need and the lists of what I'll say",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then in the morning on the step a sparrow comes to sing",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He doesn't know where lunch will come from, he isn't worrying",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look at the birds of the air",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They do not sow or reap or gather into barns",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And yet your heavenly Father feeds them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Are you not worth far more than they",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Consider how the lilies of the field grow",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They do not labor or spin",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet not even Solomon in all his splendor",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Was dressed like one of these",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look at the birds of the air",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They do not sow or reap or gather into barns",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And yet your heavenly Father feeds them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are you not worth far more than they",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But seek first his kingdom and his righteousness",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all these things will be given to you as well",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So do not worry about tomorrow",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For tomorrow will worry about itself",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your heavenly Father knows that you need them all",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your heavenly Father knows",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
